# PROFILE sixteen bit instruction fuel charged before each guest effect
# LIMITATION source and fuel representation bounded to sixty five thousand five hundred thirty five
# LIMITATION no guest loops pointer travel or input and no trusted host closure
# LIMITATION development diagnostic trailing byte is not authoritative BFIO status
# END header

